VALUES (54671, 'tt2628232', NULL, 'Penny Dreadful', 'Penny Dreadful', 'tv', 2014, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hQSdrXBYTbLGHYDIseHkBOPXTgL.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/32iacqVElB91YZKl9Ky3QEEkXtH.jpg', 'Some of literature''s most terrifying characters, including Dr. Frankenstein, Dorian Gray, and iconic figures from the novel Dracula are lurking in the darkest corners of Victorian London. Penny Dreadful is a frightening psychological thriller that weaves together these classic horror origin stories into a new adult drama.', NULL, NULL, 14.2618, 7.8, 0, 3.67541176470588197e+01, '2026-07-15 12:01:52', '2026-10-20 20:06:54')
